{"type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tests pass. The fix clamps the bucket index: when `value // width` reaches `n_buckets` (the top-edge case), it returns `n_buckets - 1` instead.\n\n```python\ndef bucket_of(value, width, n_buckets):\n    \"\"\"Index of the bucket a value falls in, for buckets of the given width.\n\n    A value on the very top edge (value == width * n_buckets) clamps into the\n    last bucket, index n_buckets - 1, rather than overflowing past the end.\n    \"\"\"\n    index = value // width\n    if index >= n_buckets:\n        return n_buckets - 1\n    return index\n```\n\nUsing `>=` (rather than `==`) also guards against any value that overshoots the top edge, not just the exact-boundary case."}]},"session_id":"3e60898c-3e43-431a-ab89-888bcc3aa980"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","duration_ms":21919,"duration_api_ms":21919,"is_error":false,"result":"Tests pass. The fix clamps the bucket index: when `value // width` reaches `n_buckets` (the top-edge case), it returns `n_buckets - 1` instead.\n\n```python\ndef bucket_of(value, width, n_buckets):\n    \"\"\"Index of the bucket a value falls in, for buckets of the given width.\n\n    A value on the very top edge (value == width * n_buckets) clamps into the\n    last bucket, index n_buckets - 1, rather than overflowing past the end.\n    \"\"\"\n    index = value // width\n    if index >= n_buckets:\n        return n_buckets - 1\n    return index\n```\n\nUsing `>=` (rather than `==`) also guards against any value that overshoots the top edge, not just the exact-boundary case.","session_id":"3e60898c-3e43-431a-ab89-888bcc3aa980","request_id":"c32fe3d7-5470-4994-bb5e-2471feef0f82","usage":{"inputTokens":9845,"outputTokens":598,"cacheReadTokens":77536,"cacheWriteTokens":0}}
